// =============================================================================
// Chora Payments — Identity KYC Fee events (Stripe-driven)
// =============================================================================
//
// Aggregate root: IdentityKycFee (1:1 with a Stripe Checkout session for the
//                 one-time KYC manual-doc verification fee per ADR-142:
//                 Singpass-verified GCID is FREE; manual-doc KYC is $9.99).
// Owning domain : Payments (chora_payments DB, per ADR-164).
// Topic prefix  : chora.payments.identity_kyc_fee.*
//
// Closes Stage E debt: chora-identity used to charge the $9.99 manual KYC
// fee inline (direct Stripe-go import on chora-identity's HTTP handler).
// Stage A.5 extracts that charge to chora-payments as a 7th aggregate.
//
// Lifecycle: one-time charge with the canonical 5 payment-phase states only.
// No additional FSM beyond shared.State.
//
// Originating-service notification path: chora-identity subscribes to
// `chora.payments.identity_kyc_fee.payment_captured.v1` and marks the
// KYC verification as paid (its existing logic completes the manual-review
// pipeline on its side once the fee clears).
